# Welcome to ranveer.me

This site is a place for me to write about things I find interesting, document projects I’m working on, and develop ideas as I learn more.

A lot of what interests me sits somewhere between economics, finance and technology - particularly how systems behave, how incentives shape outcomes, and how new technologies change the way people and markets operate.

I also want to use this space to document some of the things I build, from data projects to astrophotography and hardware.

This is the first version of the site, so it will probably change a lot over time.